## Scope Boundary

This decision preserves and measures source provenance.

It does not determine:

- hard-negative sampling weights
- training loss weights
- batch composition
- active-learning priority
- whether new model predictions may become reference evidence

Model predictions still require expert review before entering a later dataset version.